---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TitleBand from "../components/TitleBand.astro";
import PullQuote from "../components/PullQuote.astro";
import EnquiryForm from "../components/EnquiryForm.astro";
import CourseEntry from "../components/CourseEntry.astro";
import { STARTING_COURSES } from "../config/starting-courses.mjs";
import Tracked from "../components/Tracked.astro";
import { EVENTS } from "../config/analytics.mjs";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import portrait from "../assets/photos/DSC08683-Edit.jpg";
import { pages } from "../config/compatibility.mjs";
import { loadTrainingPrices, trainingPriceCopy } from "../lib/training-prices.mjs";
import "../styles/home.css";

// Priced only when SHOW_TRAINING_PRICES=true; otherwise every price stays "Price on request".
const priced = trainingPriceCopy(loadTrainingPrices());
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Power BI and AI training with Alan | burningsuit"
  description="Power BI and AI training with Alan Harman-Box, for people whose job isn't Power BI. Find a course, or get help with your own reports."
  placeholder={false}
>
  {pages[""].map((id) => <span id={id} aria-hidden="true" />)}
  <TitleBand heading={{ before: "Power BI training for people whose job ", em: "isn't", after: " Power BI." }} class="home-title">
    <Fragment slot="standfirst">Learn how Power BI works, and how to start working with AI agents on it.</Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="actions"><a class="button" href="#training">Find a course</a><a class="button" href="#consultancy">Get help with your own reports</a></Fragment>
  </TitleBand>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="introduction home-opening" aria-labelledby="page-title">
      <div class="intro-copy">
      <p>If you build the reports because <strong>someone</strong> has to, you're who I teach. I explain how Power BI fits together and why it works the way it does, so you can get back to your actual job and worry about Power BI less. If you've already built a report, I can also show you how to start working with an AI agent: a tool that reads a report's files, makes the changes you ask for and shows you what it did.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="alan-photo framed-photo">
        <Image src={portrait} alt="Alan Harman-Box smiling, outdoors under trees" widths={[400, 640, 960, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 44px), 640px" format="webp" loading="eager" />
      </figure>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="courses wrap" id="training" aria-labelledby="training-title">
      <h2 id="training-title">Find your starting point</h2>
      <div class="course-list">
        <CourseEntry course={STARTING_COURSES.fundamentals}>
          <Fragment slot="facts">
            <li>2 days</li>
            <li>Private, for your team</li>
            {priced ? <li>{priced.homeFundamentals}</li> : <><li>On site or online</li><li>Price on request</li></>}
          </Fragment>
          <p slot="deciding" class="solo-ask">On your own? <a href="/training/#coaching">Coaching starts wherever you are.</a></p>
          <a slot="actions" class="text-link" href="#contact">Ask about dates</a>
        </CourseEntry>
        <CourseEntry course={STARTING_COURSES.agents101}>
          <Fragment slot="facts">
            <li>{STARTING_COURSES.agents101.mode}</li>
            <li><span class="fact-label">Public course:</span> <time datetime="2027-01-20">Wednesday 20 January 2027</time>, <span class="together">9:30am to 12:30pm UK time</span>, <span class="together">4 to 8 people</span></li>
            {priced && <li>{priced.publicSeat}</li>}
            <li>{STARTING_COURSES.agents101.privateFact}</li>
          </Fragment>
          <Fragment slot="actions">{priced ? <Tracked event={EVENTS.bookSeatLink}><a class="text-link" href="/training/power-bi-with-ai-agents-101/#book-title">Book a seat</a></Tracked> : <a class="text-link" href="#contact">Ask about a seat</a>}</Fragment>
        </CourseEntry>
      </div>

      <div class="specialists">
        <p class="specialists-lead">Want to dive deeper into Power BI?</p>
        <ul class="specialist-names dot-list">
          <li><a href="/training/dax-fundamentals/">DAX fundamentals</a> <span class="days">(1 day)</span></li>
          <li><a href="/training/dax-deep-dive/">DAX deep dive</a> <span class="days">(2 days)</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p>Private courses for teams, on Power BI's calculations. <a href="/training/">Compare all courses</a></p>
      </div>

      <p class="not-sure">Not sure which fits? <a href="#contact">Tell me what you use Power BI for now, and I'll suggest where to start.</a></p>
    </section>


  <section id="teaching" class="teacher wrap" aria-labelledby="teacher-title">
    <div class="teacher-teaching">
      <h2 id="teacher-title">Understanding that lasts</h2>
      <p>You see what each part is for before you learn how it works. In Power BI fundamentals, you build a report from an Excel table before anything else, so everything that follows has a purpose you've already seen.</p>
      <p>I'm teaching towards the moment someone says, "Oh, I get it. I always did that, but I never knew why it worked." That's the understanding you take back to your desk.</p>
      <p>Bring your questions. I write and teach every course myself, so when a question leads down a useful rabbit hole, I can follow it and still bring you back to the course.</p>
      <PullQuote quote="The way you broke down complex concepts really helped clarify a lot of things." cite="Performance support officer, a local authority" />
    </div>
    <div class="teacher-origin">
      <p>I'm Alan Harman-Box. burningsuit was my parents' Power BI training business. My mum, Alison, said it was for "everyone else". She and my dad, Stuart, have retired now and handed it on to me. It's still for everyone else.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/about/">More about me</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="consultancy" class="raised-band" aria-labelledby="consultancy-title">
    <div class="wrap raised-inner">
      <h2 id="consultancy-title">Help with your own reporting</h2>
      <div class="raised-copy">
        <p>If everything depends on the one person who understands the reports, or two reports give different answers to the same question, I can help. I work alongside your team on your own reports and models, so they understand what we build, can change it and know what will happen when they do.</p>
        <Tracked event={EVENTS.bookCallLink}><a class="button" href="/call/">Book a free 30-minute call</a></Tracked>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <EnquiryForm>
    <Fragment slot="heading">Tell me what you're looking for.</Fragment>
    You don't need to know which course you want yet. Tell me what you're working with and where you'd like to get to, and I'll help you work out the next step.
  </EnquiryForm>
</BaseLayout>
